This Guide Does:

- Fully expect readers to be familiar with the basics of Elite Dangerous and not need their hand held through every menu.
- Try to provide you a ramp to System Architect mastery from basic to advanced concepts without wasting your time
- Still want to discuss some of the more “in-the-weeds” concepts and tables in Appendices without overly confusing/cluttering the guide for newer Commanders.
- Expect that Commanders are fully capable of finding and opening the Codex and Help menus in-game to be able to read FDev’s documentation.
- Intend to be more sympathetic to smaller/solo Trailblazers than group efforts
- Wish to apologize for front-loading so much information in the very first/basics section, but it really is actually necessary to know to be able to make informed decisions about colony claims
- Have opinions on Elite in general and Trailblazers in particular, but tries to ensure that they do not impede/slow the imparting important information
- Have internal links that may or may not be visible in certain file formats
- Acknowledge that the author’s Construction Supply Depot tendencies may cast a shadow the guide in some areas.
- Expect readers to listen to Commander Ian Doncaster if he disagrees with aspects of this guide. Ian Doncaster understands these systems better than almost anyone else.

This Guide Does not:

- Cover so-called “System Sniping.” 
- Cover a “lack” of an Undo/Deletion button, especially after commodities have been delivered or a construction has been completed.
- Cover every stat down to the hundredth decimal (at this time). That is left to the spreadsheet and app makers for now.
- Intend to be a repository of FDev patch notes and/or in-game documentation.
- Expect to be 100% perfect but will always strive for as close to 100% accuracy as possible and incorporate corrections as pertinent.
- Consider using Assists to be a personal or moral failing, and will make suggestions accordingly. Though the author acknowledges this can be a contentious topic.
- Cover Powerplay because you must “drag” Powerplay over already colonized systems
